{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Hardy and resilient, you gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You have advantange on Death Saving Throws\n\n- As a bonus action, you can expend one of your Hit Dice, roll the die, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to the die.","level":1}],"id":"Custom24364cdf-2969-4313-8af7-d68c89e57631","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Durable [NPHB] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}